[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3028649154","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108038#issuecomment-3028649154","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108038","id":3028649154,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60hYTC","user":{"login":"arlez80","id":5057625,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNTc2MjU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5057625?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arlez80","html_url":"https://github.com/arlez80","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arlez80/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arlez80/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arlez80/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arlez80/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arlez80/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arlez80/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arlez80/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arlez80/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arlez80/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-02T17:21:15Z","updated_at":"2025-07-02T17:33:41Z","body":"> However, in the MRP, the rightmost ray (hidden by default) no longer hits the shape, even though it has Hit Back Faces enabled.\r\n\r\nIt seems required true to `ConcavePolygonShape3D.backface_collision`.\r\nThis parameter is set as default (=false) in MRP.\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.4/classes/class_raycast3d.html#class-raycast3d-property-hit-back-faces\r\nIf true, the ray will hit back faces with **concave polygon shapes with back face enabled** or heightmap shapes.\r\n\r\nInsert following code test.gd in MPR, it will be all hit in 4.4.1.stable and my fixed code.\r\n`collision_shape3d.shape.backface_collision = true`\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dbc1cce7-7ceb-4bc6-a617-eeacf95d36ac)\r\n\r\n> Enabling Hit from Inside also doesn't change the result, and neither does switching to Jolt Physics.\r\n\r\nI think this is the correct behavior as the manual.\r\n`Mesh.create_trimesh_shape` is returns `ConcavePolygonShape3D`.\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.4/classes/class_raycast3d.html#class-raycast3d-property-hit-from-inside\r\nDoes not affect shapes with no volume like concave polygon or heightmap.\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3028649154/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3033023130","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108038#issuecomment-3033023130","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108038","id":3033023130,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60yEKa","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-03T17:27:38Z","updated_at":"2025-07-03T17:27:38Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3033023130/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]